noalternative wrote:
> Is there a file where I can turn the sound off?

In the game, click on the interface options button (the button with
the wrench), and disable options [b] play music and [c] play effects.
(I found the button in Vulture's Eye 2.1.1.)

Outside of the game, you could edit ~/.vultures/vultures.conf (or
whatever Falcon's called the equivalent file) so that it contains
play_music=1 and play_effects=1

